  "prefLabel": "Ncr 744.01 Group Reservation Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 744.01 Group Reservation Required. Except for uses requiring a special use permit under Ncr 743.01 or excluded under Ncr 741.03, any reserved or exclusive use of department lands, facilities, and resources, such as but not limited to pavilions, group use areas, the Hampton Beach Seashell, and associated function areas, and trails, used for private parties, gatherings, meetings, and activities, shall require advance reservation.\n\nSource. #14056 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14292, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
